# The three ontology/rest suites that had a `rust_test` target and NOTHING else:
# no wrapper here, no ci.yml step, no entry in either locked list in
# scripts/check-ci-preflight.mjs. They executed nowhere -- the seventh instance
# of the four-coupled-places defect, and the two worst of them are precisely the
# suites that break when an action starts reading its target through the
# object-policy gate. CI was structurally incapable of observing that.
#
